{"meta":{"id":"tt33165027","type":"series","name":"Witch Watch","imdb_id":"tt33165027","description":"Morihito Otogi es un estudiante de preparatoria con la fuerza de un ogro. Su vida transcurre en paz hasta que su amiga de la infancia y bruja en prácticas, Nico Wakatsuki, se muda a su casa. Nico está entusiasmada con su reencuentro y convierte a Morihito en su familiar. Ahora Morihito tendrá que centrarse en su misión de proteger a Nico de los peligros que le profetizaron. Así comienzan sus días llenos de misticismo y problemas.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt33165027.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yTfaG7igCJa324DU0QaxCTzYBXF.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aqjQMJKjm71xPBfBuHh5FgH7Jja.png","genres":["Animación","Comedia","Sci-Fi & Fantasy"],"releaseInfo":"2025-","released":"2025-04-06T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Returning Series","runtime":"24 min","imdbRating":"6.8","country":"Japan","cast":["川口莉奈","鈴木崚汰","天﨑滉平","石川界人","楠木ともり","小松未可子","高橋李依","小原好美","松岡禎丞","沢城みゆき","福山潤","釘宮理恵","久野美咲","日髙のり子","三宅健太","福島潤","Hikaru Midorikawa","水樹奈々","小西克幸"],"writer":["赤尾でこ","すりぃ","篠原健太"],"trailers":[{"source":"0D5vUtCLHrM","type":"Trailer","name":"Official Trailer (English Dub)","ytId":"0D5vUtCLHrM","lang":"en"},{"source":"mLOi_84AlOg","type":"Trailer","name":"Official Trailer 3 [Subtitled]","ytId":"mLOi_84AlOg","lang":"en"},{"source":"-YbRZrOXMo0","type":"Trailer","name":"Official Trailer 2 (English Subtitles)","ytId":"-YbRZrOXMo0","lang":"en"},{"source":"2jTpus79jNQ","type":"Trailer","name":"Official Trailer 1 (English Subtitles)","ytId":"2jTpus79jNQ","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"0D5vUtCLHrM","title":"Official Trailer (English Dub)"},{"ytId":"mLOi_84AlOg","title":"Official Trailer 3 [Subtitled]"},{"ytId":"-YbRZrOXMo0","title":"Official Trailer 2 (English Subtitles)"},{"ytId":"2jTpus79jNQ","title":"Official Trailer 1 (English Subtitles)"}],"links":[{"name":"6.8","category":"imdb",