nail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10969419/screencap/6814ca86c1092.jpg","released":"2025-05-04T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt33165027:1:6","season":1,"episode":6,"title":"6. Bajo el árbol que une a la gente","overview":"La clase de Nico se va de excursión a un sitio con una leyenda que asegura que se formen parejas duraderas.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10969420/screencap/681e0b0e2b83f.jpg","released":"2025-05-11T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt33165027:1:7","season":1,"episode":7,"title":"7. El canal Kan&Nico. El té es pan comido.","overview":"Kanshi y Nico empiezan un canal de WJTube y Morihito domina la ceremonia del té.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10969421/screencap/6827395da1758.jpg","released":"2025-05-18T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt33165027:1:8","season":1,"episode":8,"title":"8. Los trabajos de Kanshi: Show de héroes y Trabajo desde casa","overview":"Morihito insta a Kanshi a trabajar para aportar dinero en casa y lo vemos probar dos empleos distintos.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10969422/screencap/683077dc006a8.jpg","released":"2025-05-25T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt33165027:1:9","season":1,"episode":9,"title":"9. Para Kara. Una nueva amistad. Cita con el caballero","overview":"Kara quiere reparar una carta triturada, Nico hace un nuevo amigo y Morihito la invita al cine.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10969423/screencap/683b87530fb0e.jpg","released":"2025-06-01T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt33165027:1:10","season":1,"episode":10,"title":"10. El consejo cliché. Momentos fugaces con un gato","overview":"Morihito y Nico conocen al consejo estudiantil y Nemu hace una nueva visita gatuna a la casa de Morihito.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10969424/screencap/6842c2542bfdf.jpg","released":"2025-06-08T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt33165027:1:11","season":1,"episode":11,"title":"11. Un perro y gotas de lluvia: primera parte","overview":"Una hechicera y su familiar van tras Nico. Morihito formula un plan para protegerla, pero algo sale mal.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10969425/screencap/684c1339b1008.jpg","released":"2025-06-15T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt33165027:1:12","season":1,"episode":12,"title":"12. Un perro y gotas de lluvia: segunda parte","overview":"Tras una sorprendente revelación, Morihito se enfrenta a Wolf mientras Nico busca a la hechicera.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10969426/screencap/685539ab22f95.jpg","released":"2025-06-22T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt33165027:1:13","season":1,"episode":13,"title":"13. El hombre lobo Keigo Magami. Tigre amable, lobo orgulloso. Condimentos cautivadores.","overview":"Con un nuevo inquilino en casa, la vida de Nico y Morihito se vuelve aún más caótica.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10969427/screencap/685ea11ebdcb4.jpg","released":"2025-06-29T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt33165027:1:14","season":1,"episode":14,"title":"14. Uron Mirage capítulo 119: \"Opresión de Phasey 4\". Diario de una fan artist.","overview":"Nos adentramos en la historia de Uron Mirage y en la vida de las fans que crean contenido de la serie.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10969428/screencap/6867c73fca523.jpg","released":"2025-07-06T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt33165027:1:15","season":1,"episode":15,"title":"15. Monstruo de verano","overview":"Nico recibe una nueva profecía de su madre que la impulsa a encontrarse con un grupo misterioso.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10969429/screencap/6870f8abe5968.jpg","released":"2025-07-13T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt33165027:1:16","season":1,"episode":16,"title":"16. El vampiro Miharu Kiryu. No tengo paraguas. Me alegro de verte.","overview":"Miharu se une a la casa de Morihito y Nemu comienza su misión de transformar a Keigo en Wolf.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10969430/screencap/687a5650f0244.jpg","released":"2025-07-20T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt33165027:1:17","season":1,"episode":17,"title":"17. Participo en un concurso mortal, pero es un fastidio. LONG LONG A GO GO","overview":"Alguien secuestra a Nico para forzar a sus compañeros de hogar a jugar y luego un hechizo sale mal.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10969431/screencap/6883994d1cfa6.jpg","released":"2025-07-27T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt33165027:1:18","season":1,"episode":18,"title":"18. Kara y Shiki. Fiebre de las canicas. Scramble Scrap Squad","overview":"Kara crea un shikigami, las canicas se ponen de moda y Morihito encuentra un antiguo cómic.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10969432/screencap/688c9274964b0.jpg","released":"2025-08-03T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt33165027:1:19","season":1,"episode":19,"title":"19. Carta de una amiga","overview":"Morihito encuentra una antigua carta de Nico que quizás esconda un oscuro secreto.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10969433/screencap/6895e7bbea283.jpg","released":"2025-08-10T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt33165027:1:20","season":1,"episode":20,"title":"20. El lobo perdido y el gato de visita","overview":"Keigo se siente algo impotente al no contribuir a defender a Nico y esta le dará algo que tal vez ayude.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10969434/screencap/689f12d125aa8.jpg","released":"2025-08-17T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt33165027:1:21","season":1,"episode":21,"title":"21. Impulso secreto. El estilo espontáneo de Keigo. Visita de Jekyll a la casa Otogi.","overview":"El canal de Keigo sufre cambios y Miharu hace un nuevo amigo en la escuela y lo invita a la casa Otogi.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10969435/screencap/68a84f96a7e2d.jpg","released":"2025-08-24T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt33165027:1:22","season":1,"episode":22,"title":"22. La increíble aventura encogedora","overview":"Nico usa su magia para encogerse, ayudar a una compañera enamorada y hacer feliz a Morihito en su cumpleaños.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10969436/screencap/68b17f45e4392.jpg","released":"2025-08-31T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt33165027:1:23","season":1,"episode":23,"title":"23. Primera reunión offline. Fan Artist Log: Aluvión de inspiración. Fan Artist Log: Los pormenores de un evento.","overview":"En este episodio seguimos las aventuras del dúo de fanartists formado por Kukumi Ureshino y Yuri Makuwa.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10969437/screencap/68c40144b2597.jpg","released":"2025-09-14T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt33165027:1:24","season":1,"episode":24,"title":"24. El camino de mezclilla de Moi / Cita con el guía","overview":"Morihito, además de ser fan de los jeans, considera que puede planear una cita perfecta.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10969438/screencap/68cd2c99e8e1e.jpg","released":"2025-09-21T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt33165027:1:25","season":1,"episode":25,"title":"25. La bruja principiante y sus familiares","overview":"El festival escolar de la preparatoria Asunaro está en pleno desarrollo, pero una amenaza pone en alerta a los familiares de Nico.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11069280/screencap/68dfa3e2ae7d9.jpg","released":"2025-10-05T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt33165027:2:1","season":2,"episode":1,"title":"26. Episode 1","runtime":"24 min"}]}}